[
  {
    "pkheadingid": 457,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Definition",
    "headingPosition": 1,
    "headingid": 370,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65217,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Chondroid syringoma is a benign vulvar tumour with an admixture of epithelial, myoepithelial, and stromal elements.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 458,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-O coding",
    "headingPosition": 2,
    "headingid": 371,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65218,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 371,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>8940/0 Chondroid syringoma NOS</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 459,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 372,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65219,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 372,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>GA13.Y &amp; XH70N8 Other specified acquired abnormalities of vulva or perineum &amp; Chondroid syringoma</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 460,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 373,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65220,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 373,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Acceptable:</em> pleomorphic adenoma; mixed tumour of the vulva</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 461,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 374,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65221,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 374,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 462,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65222,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>There is wide distribution on the vulva {16681787}. These tumours may arise from the Bartholin gland or other vestibular glands, or from anogenital mammary-like glands {22532914}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65223,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Patients are usually postmenopausal and typically present with a slow-growing, solitary, painless nodule {22532914}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65224,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are uncommon vulvar neoplasms.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65225,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65226,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The <em>PLAG1</em> gene on chromosome&nbsp;8q12 is consistently rearranged in pleomorphic adenomas of the salivary glands {9525740} but has not been investigated in vulvar tumours.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65227,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Chondroid syringoma is typically a well-defined round to ovoid mass &lt;&nbsp;3&nbsp;cm in diameter, with a solid or solid and cystic, white, glistening cut surface.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65228,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Histology typically shows a dermal-based, well-circumscribed lesion with epithelial, myoepithelial, and stromal elements. The epithelial cells form tubules or trabeculae with associated myoepithelial cells, which may have a clear cell, plasmacytoid, or spindled appearance. The stromal element is typically fibromyxoid but can exhibit adipocytic, chondroid, or osseous differentiation.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65229,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The cytology is similar to that of the corresponding salivary gland tumours {26619021}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65230,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65231,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> admixture of epithelial, myoepithelial, and stromal elements.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65232,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65233,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 377,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The tumour may recur if incompletely excised. Rare cases of adenocarcinoma arising in chondroid syringoma of the vulva have been reported {14501823}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:25:39"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]